80313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"アキム","textMapHash":1042157642,"text":"それはつまり、建築材料だけじゃなく、陶器にも、他の色々なものにも応用が利くってことだ！","nextNodeIds":[230080314,230080315]},{"nodeId":230080314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":817457770,"text":"おめでとう！","nextNodeIds":[230080316]},{"nodeId":230080316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"アキム","textMapHash":1455559242,"text":"ありがとう、これが上の賢い連中がよく言う、「砂を集めて塔と成す」なんだろうな。","nextNodeIds":[230080317]},{"nodeId":230080317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"アキム","textMapHash":1170935402,"text":"この泥土は地味かもしれないが、今に天に通じる塔を作ることもできるかもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[230080318]},{"nodeId":230080318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"アキム","textMapHash":3831580570,"text":"俺はこの混合型泥土のことを「セメン土」と呼ぶことにするよ。","nextNodeIds":[230080319]},{"nodeId":230080319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"アキム","textMapHash":746352386,"text":"さあ、次にしなきゃならないのは、この「セメン土」が何に使えるかの実験だ…","nextNodeIds":[230080320]},{"nodeId":230080320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"アキム","textMapHash":3628248490,"text":"長い間みんなを困らせていた家の問題も、やっと解決の糸口が見えたぞ。","nextNodeIds":[230080321]},{"nodeId":230080321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"アキム","textMapHash":2372816714,"text":"旅人さんには本当に感謝している。これは報酬だ。受け取ってくれ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":230080315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1011578986,"text":"やっと成果が出たね！","nextNodeIds":[230080316]},{"nodeId":230080309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2829646402,"text":"パイモンが好きそうだね？","nextNodeIds":[230080310]},{"nodeId":230080310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":342335322,"text":"オイラは土なんて食べないぞ！","nextNodeIds":[230080311]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2300803,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE